{
 "_doc": "The Witcher rune system (docs/research/WORLD_LOCATIONS.md): numbered runes at treasure-map dig spots all over the map, sold as a set of 14-15 rune tomes. Coordinates: ExploreOutlands' Witchers_Tmap_Locations.csv (fetched 2026-10-03; ids rarely change): the dig spot, which a library's own rune may miss by a few tiles (the DTF guild set lands up to 36 tiles off; its 165 is 100 tiles east). Names: read live from the Cambria Rune Library tomes on 2026-10-03 (rows 'N - Place name'). Which tome of which library holds a rune, and where that rune lands: harness/data/rune_libraries.json. Rune 83 is in the tomes but not in the coordinate table.",
